1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Welcome to this video.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,500
Today we'll learn about caption formats.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
YouTube's timedtext API returns SRT format
when called with fmt=srt parameter.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The SRT format includes sequence numbers,
timestamps, and text lines.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,500
We strip numbers and timestamps
to get clean plain text.
